AUDIO: 'This video was supposed to be part of the previous&nbsp; video where I explained the Krea 2 Edit nodes,&nbsp;&nbsp; but due to my work schedule,&nbsp; I wasn\'t able to include it.&nbsp; I have been using these three LoRAs recently:&nbsp; the Style Transfer LoRA, the Head Swap LoRA,&nbsp;&nbsp; which works really well, and the Body Swap LoRA,&nbsp; which I have been using for body pose transfer.&nbsp;'

[00:14] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'The Style Transfer LoRA is available on Hugging&nbsp; Face along with a few other LoRAs. This Cyanide &amp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Happiness style is my favorite, but you may face&nbsp; copyright issues if you use these characters.&nbsp;'

[00:28] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'The workflow is also provided as a&nbsp; PNG image, but you can download the&nbsp;&nbsp; JSON file from the video\'s description. The custom node used in this workflow is&nbsp;&nbsp; by a different user on GitHub, but&nbsp; the overall logic remains the same.&nbsp;'

[00:44] [scene:talk]
