AUDIO: 'your card details, it\'s better to type them&nbsp; manually instead of using your browser\'s autofill.&nbsp; For example, I get autofill suggestions here. This Buy Me a Coffee website is secure,&nbsp;&nbsp; and I do not doubt it. However, if you\'re using an&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[03:55] [scene:talk]
